{"id": 3, "ts": 1780652728.7729747, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I\u2019d like to put Candidate\u202fC forward as the current leading choice.\u202fHe is described as 100\u202f% reliable and consistently makes correct decisions quickly\u2014both core to operational reliability and decision quality on long\u2011distance flights.\u202fHe also \u201ccreates a positive atmosphere with his crew,\u201d which directly supports crew cooperation and professional communication, essential for safe cockpit dynamics.\u202fWhile we have notes that he has difficulty communicating ideas, is seen as egocentric, and is not very willing to further his education, these concerns are outweighed by his proven reliability, rapid decision\u2011making, and ability to foster a positive crew environment.\u202fIf needed, targeted coaching on communication and continuous\u2011learning expectations can address those gaps without compromising safety."}
